#: core/KexiStandardAction.cpp:47
msgid "&Ascending"
msgstr "&Crexhant"

#: core/KexiStandardAction.cpp:48
msgid "Sort data in ascending order"
msgstr "Relére les dnêyes dins èn ôre crexhant"

#: core/KexiStandardAction.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Sorts data in ascending order (from A to Z and from 0 to 9). Data from "
"selected column is used for sorting."
msgstr ""
"Relé les dnêyes èn ôre crexhant (di A a Z eyet d' 0 a 9). Les dnêyes del "
"colone di tchoezeye sont-st eployeyes po relére."

#: core/KexiStandardAction.cpp:51
msgid "&Descending"
msgstr "&Discrexhant"

#: core/KexiStandardAction.cpp:52
msgid "Sort data in descending order"
msgstr "Relére les dnêyes dins èn ôre discrexhant"

#: core/KexiStandardAction.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Sorts data in descending (from Z to A and from 9 to 0). Data from selected "
"column is used for sorting."
msgstr ""
"Relé les dnêyes èn ôre discrexhant (di Z a A eyet d' 9 a 0). Les dnêyes del "
"colone di tchoezeye sont-st eployeyes po relére."

